  "net/minecraft/class_5944.method_34418()V": "attachToProgram(): re-attached the vertex and fragment Program to the GL program; 1.21.2 links a core shader program from compiled vertex/fragment shaders it does not keep: class_281 (Program) is gone and CompiledShaderProgram holds no shader objects, so there is no Program to answer (checked: class_5944 and class_10151 of 1.21.2 keep no reference to the compiled shaders after linking)"
 },
